Cell["\<\
Load TBMethod on subkernels and distribute user-defined hopping functions \
before a parallel calculation. The package changes $DistributedContexts when \
loaded.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1307233487,ExpressionUUID->"68bde3d4-8568-d14d-9340-15e8527b3487"],

